  "body": "The maintainer reported this in chat on 2026-11-15: the documentation says that the browser version cannot open or save files, and this is not correct.\n\nWhat the site says:\n\n- `site/templates/index.html` line 31: \"It cannot open or save files yet (models, projects and programs)\".\n- `site/content/guide/first-run.md` line 13: \"The browser version cannot open or save files yet\".\n\nWhat the browser version does since v0.20.0 (PR #1314, PR #1438, `crates/ui/src/browser_files.rs`):\n\n- It opens a model and a project with the file picker of the browser.\n- Save, Save As and Post download the project and the program.\n- It refuses by name: the other open commands (fixture, machine, post, theme, tool library, tool body), recent files, the fixture library folder, the post of each operation into a folder, and the exports of the setup sheet, the tool list and the stock STL (#1437).\n\nDone means: the two pages say what the browser version can open and save, and what it cannot.\n",
